#ETH  trend analysis
Figure 1 weekly chart, the closing wasn't good, the weekly closing is just below the high point of 2330, the downtrend has been confirmed;
Figure 2 daily chart, the current pattern is a false breakout of a flat-top triangle and has fallen back, the expectation is a pullback to the upper line followed by a continued decline;
Figure 3 H4, there is a 4H level FVG expected to be filled, a small-scale MSB appears here, which allows for a short position
Figure 4 H1, it depends on whether it's at 0.5 OB or 0.618 here, closely monitor the 15-minute level, and be ready to enter at any time,
